{"id":1030402,"chapter_id":1030402,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"幽暗的小巷，闪烁的昏黄灯光被街道深处的黑暗吞没。你和阿黛拉两人驻足于此。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"您的“计划”……就是造访一间可能超过十年没有人居住的公寓吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"你点了点头。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"您或许应该带上您在MBCC的下属来执行这项计划，而不是和新城人谈之色变的“疯剪子”一起。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"……这里似乎没有目击者。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"这项调查一开始需要的就不是客观且冰冷的取证。我要了解的是“疯剪子”的起点，你内心真实的想法。","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"因此我必须由你陪同。即便存在风险，也在我的可接受范围之内。","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"而且想必，“疯剪子”不会毫无缘故地袭击一个没有沉重烦恼的人，不是吗？","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"你一边说着，一边在黑暗中艰难地摸索到了目的地的方向。阿黛拉笑了笑，跟上了你。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"你们停在了一处老旧的复式公寓门前。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"多塞街12号E室……你还记得这里吗？","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"沉默便是回答。你的提问更像是闲极无聊的喃喃自语。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"穿过楼道，你打着手电一间间观察门牌号。终于，你在楼道的尽头看到了一个显眼的“E”字母。","style":3,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"你将之前从阿黛拉行李箱中找到的钥匙翻了出来，依次插进锁孔。锁芯早已生锈，钥匙的保存状态也远算不上好。这花了你不少时间。","style":3,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"终于，在一次费尽力气的转动之后，房间的门被打开了。","style":3,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"咳咳咳咳……","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"浓重的灰尘和霉味呛得你几乎睁不开眼睛。手电筒的光照射进去，仿佛是照在一杯浑浊的液体当中。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"咔哒——","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"正当你踌躇之际，一声清脆的开关声响起，你们头顶的灯泡嗡鸣着发出了微弱的冷光。等你意识过来发生了什么时，阿黛拉已经在用手帕擦拭沾在手套上的灰尘了。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"这……居然还能亮？有人一直在给这里缴纳电费吗？","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"新城普通的市民们节省家用的惯用手段罢了。只是没想到电路没有故障……唔，该说运气不错吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"说话间，阿黛拉从房间正对面的公共清洁区找来了几件清洁用具。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"至少得清理出一片可以立足的地方……这也许要花费一点时间。您先休息一会儿。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"你眼见着阿黛拉以惊人的效率将原本杂乱的房间整理完毕。堆叠的垃圾被安放到了公寓楼下的垃圾箱，氤氲的灰尘更是一扫而空。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"房间的中央，一套老旧的复古桌椅被整齐地摆放着。难以想象，这个房间在半个小时前还是一间数年没有人居住的荒废公寓。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"阿黛拉甚至抽空找出了一套掉色的茶具，烧了些热水摆放在桌上。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"时间有限，暂时只能做这么多。可惜没有茶叶，这个时间也不方便叨扰邻居，只能麻烦您忍一忍了。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"我从来都不知道，理发师还有这样的技能吗？","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"通常是没有的。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"阿黛拉笑了笑。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"但我总是一个人开店，有些事情只能亲力亲为。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"阿黛拉打开窗户，柔和清凉的晚风吹进屋子，驱散了陈年的霉腐气息。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"这感觉就像……你是这间屋子的主人，而我是应邀而来参加茶会的客人。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"呵呵呵……您真的很擅长讨人欢心。不过很可惜，我知道您想说什么。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"阿黛拉的笑容中并没有丝毫的笑意。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"我只是做了些力所能及的事情，至少能让您的调查之旅舒服一些。但我对这里的其他物品没有任何印象……对我来说，这里不过就是一间老旧的公寓。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"不要紧，我会帮你回忆起来的。这就是我计划中最重要的部分。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"哦？那么您打算如何做到呢？","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"阿黛拉饶有兴致地看着你，眼神中多了些玩味和期待。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"阿黛拉，我记得你的能力。当你握紧剪刀时，就可以看到人的烦恼，对吧？","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"我的直觉告诉我，这里一定有很多很多，在多年前被剪断、遗弃的烦恼——我想看看它们，所以我需要你的帮助。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"你第一次在阿黛拉脸上看到有些为难的表情。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"为他人排忧解难是你的宗旨，不是吗？","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"不，只是……您不会喜欢看到那些东西的。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"我不在乎。我需要的从来都不是美好的假象。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"面对你的坚持，阿黛拉无奈地叹了口气。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"……好吧，如果这就是您的诉求……","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"黯淡的蓝色光芒闪烁，一柄漆黑修长的剪刀出现在阿黛拉的手中。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"options":["握住剪刀"],"style":6,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402050,"trial_step":50,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"握住剪刀","goto":51}]},{"step":51,"content":"你握住剪刀末梢的把柄，同时也触碰到了阿黛拉冰凉的皮肤。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"一瞬间，房间里的景象彻底改变了。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"content":"头发，挤满目所能及每一个角落的头发。这些虬结纠缠的头发占据着整个房间，又被某种力量吸引，漂浮于半空。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"即便是你这样“见多识广”的人，见到如此景象，额角的青筋也止不住狂跳起来。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"这就是你……眼中的世界吗？","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"阿黛拉有些无奈地笑了笑，权当是对你的回应。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"content":"你花了一些时间来适应视野中的变化。片刻后，你终于鼓起勇气，将手伸向那些蠕动的发丝。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"options":["触碰发丝"],"style":6,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402058,"trial_step":58,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"触碰发丝","goto":59}]},{"step":59,"content":"沉重的砸门声将少女从睡梦中唤醒。她看向墙面，时钟的指针已经走过了四分之一的表盘。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"少女默默从床上坐起身，快步走向房门。打开门之后，一个女人倒在了她的怀里。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"少女下意识看了一眼玄关的的挂钩，钥匙并没有挂在那里。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"少女","content":"……又弄丢了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"少女费劲全身的力气，拖动着母亲进入盥洗室。刚一进门，她就趴在马桶边呕吐起来。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"混杂着酸腐味的恶臭令人难以忍受。但更加无法接受的是，少女白天刚刚悉心打扫过的房间又被弄脏了。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"少女","content":"妈妈，你不该总是这样，身体会撑不住的。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"母亲","content":"你说什么？！","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"母亲发出异常高亢尖锐的声响。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"母亲","content":"闭嘴！你凭什么说教我？啊？！","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"speaker":"母亲","content":"我是你妈！是我生了养了你！","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"母亲","content":"就是因为当初生下了你这个累赘……我才会失去舞团的工作，沦落到要做这种下贱的事情维生……","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"母亲","content":"现在你这个没良心的还反过来教育我？让我不要这样？我不这样谁来养你？！","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"少女并没有听母亲尖锐的叫骂，相反，她在想别的事情。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"content":"现在是凌晨三点，少女明天可能不得不面对隔壁那个肥胖易怒的邻居了。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"想到这里，少女不知为何觉得有些想笑。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"母亲","content":"你那是什么表情？还有什么不满意吗？啊？！","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"speaker":"母亲","content":"有什么不满意你说啊！","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"content":"母亲尖叫着。少女只是轻轻抬起头，对女人回以温柔的微笑。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"少女","content":"抱歉，妈妈，是我不对……还有哪里不舒服吗？你需要休息了……","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"content":"这是一段充满痛苦的回忆。仅仅是看着，都令人感到窒息。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"content":"阿黛拉一直默默观察着你的反应。你看着她的眼睛，问道：","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"content":"你有回想起什么有关这个少女的事了吗？","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"content":"阿黛拉摇了摇头。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"我目睹过很多人的烦恼。这些经历，在狄斯城，在新城，不算新奇。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"content":"不用着急。这里还有很多烦恼，我们可以一个一个看过去。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"content":"说不定，这样能帮你回忆起来。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"options":["触碰发丝"],"style":6,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402086,"trial_step":86,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"触碰发丝","goto":87}]},{"step":87,"content":"太阳快要落山了，母亲还在房间里酣睡。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"content":"少女忙碌着，将灶台上的盘子端上桌。加了糖的燕麦粥散发出阵阵甜香气。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"content":"过了一会儿，母亲迈着沉重的步伐从卧室里走了出来，整个人垮在了餐桌前的椅子上。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"content":"在喝完两人份的甜粥后，她的气色终于有了些好转。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"母亲","content":"嗯……","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"content":"少女熟练地将床头散落的小镜子和化妆品递到母亲跟前。母亲要出去“工作”了，但家里并没有梳妆台那种奢侈的东西。因此化妆通常都是在饭桌上完成的。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"母亲","content":"只有在这种时候才会觉得，生你也算有点用的。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"content":"少女没有回答母亲的话，只是默默将餐盘和勺子放入洗碗池，打开了水龙头。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"speaker":"母亲","content":"说起来……","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"content":"今天母亲的心情似乎不错，居然主动搭起话来。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"speaker":"母亲","content":"你有想过以后要做什么吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"speaker":"少女","content":"……没什么。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"content":"少女知道自己答非所问。那是因为她不觉得和母亲讨论这个问题有什么意义。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"speaker":"母亲","content":"没什么是什么意思？总不至于就这么等死吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"speaker":"母亲","content":"你继承了我的容貌。这么好的条件，不管是去当明星还是模特都绰绰有余。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"content":"母亲手上化着妆，嘴却始终没有停下过。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"speaker":"少女","content":"……理发师。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"content":"或许是期待喋喋不休的母亲能少说一点，少女随口给出了一个答案。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"speaker":"母亲","content":"你说什么？","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"少女","content":"理发师，我想做理发师。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"content":"少女重复了一遍，声音也变得更加笃定。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"speaker":"母亲","content":"做理发师？为什么？理发师才能挣几个钱？","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"speaker":"少女","content":"我没有想挣很多钱……这样的生活已经很好了。但好像大家并不这么想，每天都因不开心的事而皱眉，我希望能让他们重新笑起来……","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"speaker":"母亲","content":"你有空做这些，倒不如先帮我排解没钱的烦恼！","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"speaker":"少女","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"content":"少女早就知道，和母亲谈论这种问题不会有什么好结果，再不愿开口。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"speaker":"母亲","content":"没出息的东西。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"content":"母亲丢下这句话后，便匆匆离开了家。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"content":"等到母亲的脚步声远去，少女捋了捋许久未修剪、有些乱糟糟的头发，用手指比划出剪刀的形状，嘴里喃喃自语着。","style":3,"background":1052,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"speaker":"少女","content":"咔嚓，咔嚓。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"backgr