女","content":"剪掉吧，剪掉就好……","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402166,"trial_step":166},{"step":166,"content":"少女伸出手，金属般冰凉的触感回应了她的期望。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402167,"trial_step":167},{"step":167,"content":"咔嚓——咔嚓——咔嚓——咔嚓……","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402168,"trial_step":168},{"step":168,"content":"你松开了剪刀，房间的景象回归了正常。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402169,"trial_step":169},{"step":169,"content":"阿黛拉的胸口不住起伏。显然，你们共同目睹的这一切对她而言并不轻松。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402170,"trial_step":170},{"step":170,"content":"她闭着眼，仿佛在回味那些充满痛苦悔恨的记忆。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402171,"trial_step":171},{"step":171,"content":"那就是你的过去，是你觉醒的契机。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402172,"trial_step":172},{"step":172,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"我明明已经丢掉过一次了……","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402173,"trial_step":173},{"step":173,"content":"阿黛拉睁开双眼，没有了从容与温柔，剩下的是苦涩的笑容。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402174,"trial_step":174},{"step":174,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"谢谢您，让我回想起这些本该剪断的烦恼。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402175,"trial_step":175},{"step":175,"content":"所以你消除了自己的记忆，也消除了你母亲的记忆，是吗？","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402176,"trial_step":176},{"step":176,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402177,"trial_step":177},{"step":177,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"是的。","voice":["vo_trial_30402_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":130402178,"trial_step":178},{"step":178,"content":"非要这么做不可吗……","style":2,"background":1053,"log_t